{id:"silk_sonic_debut",artist:"anderson_paak",title:"An Evening with Silk Sonic（Leave the Door Open / Smokin out the Window / 777）",year:2021,label:"Aftermath/Atlantic",genres:["Soul","Funk","R&B"],type:"studio",essential:true,producers:["Bruno Mars","D'Mile","Anderson .Paak"],analysis:".Paak 与Bruno Mars 合体、全面复刻1970年代甜蜜灵魂/放克的杰作，D'Mile 用全模拟、现场、华丽而温暖的编曲，把慢板情歌、派对与两人的默契合一。《Leave the Door Open》稳定慢速、“I ain't playin'”、横扫格莱美（年度歌曲/制作/R&B），《Smokin Out the Window》稳定、《777》。他们在trap时代把Philly/Stax式的浪漫与现场工艺带回榜首，既是怀旧也是精湛的活音乐，后来两人各自发展，这张是复古灵魂商业与艺术的高峰。",tech:"全模拟复刻、1970s甜蜜灵魂、格莱美",recs:["paak_malibu","paak_ventura"] ,tracks:["t_ss_intro","t_ss_leave_door_open","t_ss_fly_as_me","t_ss_after_last_night","t_ss_smokin_window","t_ss_777","t_ss_skate","t_ss_blast_off","t_ss_put_smile","t_ss_loves_train"]},
{id:"gorillaz_humanz",artist:"gorillaz",title:"Humanz / The Now Now（Saturnz Barz / Humility / Tranz）",year:2017,label:"Parlophone",genres:["Electronic","Hip-Hop"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["Gorillaz","Remi Kabaka"],analysis:"以“世界失控派对”为主题、大量客座（Vince Staples、Danny Brown、Pusha T、Grace Jones、Mavis Staples），《Saturnz Barz》稳定reggae，后来The Now Now 更简洁，这张是其回归、聚合当代嘻哈的记录。",tech:"客座聚合、电子派对、reggae",recs:["gorillaz_cracker","gorillaz_plastic"],tracks:["t_gz_ascension","t_gz_strobelite","t_gz_saturnz_barz","t_gz_momentz","t_gz_submission","t_gz_charger","t_gz_andromeda","t_gz_busted_blue","t_gz_carnival","t_gz_lets_me_out","t_gz_humility","t_gz_tranz","t_gz_hollywood"]},
{id:"n.e.r.d_seeing",artist:"neptunes",title:"Seeing Sounds（Everyone Nose / Spaz / Everyone Nose Remix）",year:2008,label:"Star Trak/Interscope",genres:["Funk Rock","Hip-Hop"],type:"studio",essential:false,producers:["The Neptunes"],analysis:"N.E.R.D 第三张、回归高能放克摇滚，《Everyone Nose》稳定、以派对/毒品为主题、remix 云集，《Spaz》稳定、能量爆发，他们保持太空放克与朋克能量，后来No One Ever Really Dies，这张是其中期现场化之作。",tech:"高能放克摇滚、现场化、朋克能量",recs:["n.e.r.d_no_one","n.e.r.d_fly_or_die"],tracks:["t_ne_everyone_nose_seeing","t_ne_windows","t_ne_anti_matter","t_ne_spaz_seeing","t_ne_time_action","t_ne_happy_seeing","t_ne_sooner_later_seeing","t_ne_kill_jam","t_ne_love_bomb"]}
